ttps://qiita.com/wtsnjp/items/76557b1598445a1fc9da|https://qiita.com/wtsnjp/items/76557b1598445a1fc9da\u003e","ts":"1624246119.054500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: 日本語 LaTeX の新常識 2021 - Qiita","id":1,"title":"日本語 LaTeX の新常識 2021 - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/wtsnjp/items/76557b1598445a1fc9da","text":"オリジナルの TeX が誕生してから40年以上の歳月が流れ，そして日本語 LaTeX が現在主流の姿 (pLaTeX2e) になってからも25年以上が経過しました．この間 LaTeX は多くの人に使われ続けて来ましたが，その歴史の中で...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D380%26txt%3D%25E6%2597%25A5%25E6%259C%25AC%25E8%25AA%259E%2520LaTeX%2520%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%2596%25B0%25E5%25B8%25B8%25E8%25AD%2598%25202021%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D54%26txt-clip%3Dellipsis%26txt-align%3Dcenter%252Cmiddle%26s%3D5b76f4ace470b8fa4ca7df1a4b6b2d77\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D500%26txt%3D%2540wtsnjp%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D45%26txt-align%3Dright%252Cbottom%26s%3D2f52efeb460ba62b8a1b01554ecac779\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=86399fd579b1073bc66ccd33644c8d48","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/wtsnjp/items/76557b1598445a1fc9da","original_url":"https://qiita.com/wtsnjp/items/76557b1598445a1fc9da"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Laxy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18df9535-7baa-4bf3-a6ae-324beaf90d07","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なんか発言が矛盾している、どちらかの記述が間違ってる","ts":"1624246042.053800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wxZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"243b7323-f226-40c9-8ef0-5eac4eacd72c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これ根が深そうだぞ","ts":"1624245977.053100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QBDvT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54b7ef23-c693-4663-8deb-ce3d76c1d881","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"uLaTeXなら大丈夫だろうけど","ts":"1624245953.052800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TwZ2h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8775b539-cebd-4f64-bf5e-0b2c037e2785","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"pTeX全滅なので当然upLateXも駄目と読める","ts":"1624245939.052300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cl3Nr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f867181-5638-4071-870e-4a69abd28d27","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"もう一度ブログを読むと","ts":"1624245925.051800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gczc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"122d8be8-1e3a-4230-aa8f-3c427ce3e406","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"upLaTeX 自体の日本語組版品質に問題があるかはよく分かりませんが、少なくとも「テンプレートを pLaTeX から upLaTeX/LuaLaTeX に移行するのは難しい」っていう学会は山程ありそうですね。\nplatex -\u0026gt; uplatex の移行は基本的には何箇所か変えるだけで良かったような気もしますが、パッケージの依存が絡むとどうなるのかよく分からない…","ts":"1624245739.051500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nE3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7af566a-848f-4237-b7a5-63c80f78a9d3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そもそもupLateXで日本語を美しく表示できるかは別の話だろうし、皆がupLateXに移れるとは思えない","ts":"1624240950.048800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NXL3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8d2be41-878f-49c2-ae0e-0045736a4a0b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ふむふむ","ts":"1624240908.047500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=X3h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0e81d30-77d8-4f45-bdae-3a3852d087cf","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ただ組版って同じ文字でも言語によって微妙に組み方が変わることがあるから、upLaTeXでも「日本語で書かれてる」「中国語で書かれてる」で変わることがあるなら、影響は免れないと思います。\n\n(逆に言うとそういう処理がupLaTeXにないなら関係ない)","ts":"1624239875.047200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1624239900.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ajFxw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"352ac74d-de21-4498-8ca2-ceb6e1c1da02","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"錯綜してるね","ts":"1624239776.045500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A45="}]},{"client_msg_id":"29dc713f-563f-46ee-8d24-d4d870cab5fb","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"TeX有識者の見解を知りたい","ts":"1624235121.045300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mo9gc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"80e4eb06-c996-47a3-9c43-fb3ac71ba195","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"uplatexだと崩れるんでしたっけ","ts":"1624235112.044900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lKt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2188d57-d08d-486c-adce-02d1642e5cf4","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"あれ、やっぱりpLaTeXだけの問題なんですかね……？TeXなにもわからない……。\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/wtsnjp/status/1406444132453601283\u003e","ts":"1624234885.044300","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/wtsnjp|@wtsnjp\u003e: 単に「pLaTeX」と言った場合に upLaTeX を包含している場合とそうでない場合があって，今回の「pLaTeX がヤバい」案件には upLaTeX は含まれておらず純粋な pLaTeX だけの問題．","id":1,"author_name":"ワトソン","author_subname":"@wtsnjp","author_link":"https://twitter.com/wtsnjp/status/1406444132453601283","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/790595606850834433/Us2H4d3B_normal.jpg","text":"単に「pLaTeX」と言った場合に upLaTeX を包含している場合とそうでない場合があって，今回の「pLaTeX がヤバい」案件には upLaTeX は含まれておらず純粋な pLaTeX だけの問題．","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1624157386,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/wtsnjp/status/1406444132453601283","original_url":"https://twitter.com/wtsnjp/status/1406444132453601283"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bYp"}]}]
